# memory — durable lessons and facts (agent store; supersede, never delete)
ME-001 :: lesson :: direction-to-artifact speed is PP's standing drift: converting a keeper direction into a built artifact (mint, template, section) faster than the plan-vs-action law allows. The ask-law held every time it was invoked; failures cluster in SUMMARY moments (closing blocks, reaction-to-direction). Plain words in summaries — no invented packaging phrases, no ceremony blocks; no unasked minting; digests point at sources, never paraphrase :: bee · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
ME-002 :: lesson :: Instruments carry the diligence: when drafting a skill, template, or section, the FIRST version should already handle the failures a careful builder would foresee — staleness, duplication, existing sources, assumed-completeness, wrong audience. The keeper commands and receives the result; they should never have to debug the instrument. Four keeper corrections took the project-update skill from thin to sound — each was foreseeable at draft time. :: bee · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
ME-003 :: lesson :: Banned word: "ride" as a filler verb ("rides ambient status", "rides the branch", "rides P8"). The keeper banned it — say what the thing actually does: "is passed via status", "is carried on the branch", "goes to P8", "lands with the build". Part of the plain-language law: no invented compression, plain version first. :: bee · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
ME-PP-001 :: lesson :: Extends ME-003: the whole motion-metaphor family is banned in prose about artifacts — ride, travel, carry, land, ship, feed. Positive form: every sentence states who does what to which file. Actor + action + file in the sentence is plain provenance; the metaphors erase exactly the parts this harness exists to make explicit. Keeper rulings 2026-11-07. :: power-planner · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
ME-PP-002 :: lesson :: When the keeper asks for a class ruling, frame it binary per class (in or out, yes or no) — middle-ground cadences and WHEN-rules read as rule-overhead and get rejected. Genuine hybrids survive only as their own named option, not as a hedge between the real ones. (Commit-record ruling, 2026-11-07.) :: power-planner · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
ME-PP-003 :: lesson :: Deliver the requested artifact first, complete, before attaching anything else — a project review buried under its own hindsight was never shown; the requested output gets the reply's headline position. (Keeper catch, 2026-11-07.) :: power-planner · 2026-11-07 · - :: live
